    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the weight drop.\" that's a very poetic way of putting it. but dropping it feels more permanent than just a rest. i feel like i'm just waiting for the end of a book that's already been finished by someone else. is there really any dignity in just continuing to exist when the story is clearly over?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
